  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expert Support to the African Union Commission 2025-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the development cooperation between NORCAP and the RDE is to strengthen the capacities of the targeted divisions and offices, by providing the AUC with relevant and targeted staff support through the provision of highly skilled and professional expertise to selected offices within the Commission. NORCAP&#x2019;s objective and role in this regard is therefore to recruit and employ, in a timely manner, experts that will be assigned to these offices. Through the recruitment and hiring of these experts, the receiving offices will be strengthened in terms of their ability and capacity to deliver on their mandates and priorities. The support is also crucial to ensure that staffing needs are being met, which ultimately translates into an AUC that can deliver on its objectives in a more effective manner.  
The positions fall within two categories: Peace and Security and Climate and Energy, corresponding to two of the three thematic pillars of the APPS Programme:</narrative>
  </description>
